    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Light Surrounding You\" is the second single by alternative rock band, Evermore, taken from their second studio album, \"Real Life\" (June 2006). It was written by Dann Hume, the group's drummer and lead singer and guitarists Jon Hume. The record is co-produced by Jon Hume. The song was released in October 2006 and peaked at No. 15 on the RIANZ Singles Chart in New Zealand and number one on the ARIA Singles Chart, making it Evermore's most successful single in Australia. It was the first single by a New Zealand artist to top the Australian charts since \"How Bizarre\" by OMC in 1996.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.4826089492731696,
